  "description": "For those who prefer their curry flavor without eye-watering heat, this Thai-inspired massaman chicken curry, fortified with potatoes and the citrusy, bitter flavor of wheat beer, is just the ticket.",
  "notes": "Optional or for serving: 3 tablespoons fresh juice from about 2 limes, plus lime wedges for garnish; Steamed or boiled rice, for serving; 1 cup lightly packed cilantro leaves and tender stems, for garnish; Fried shallots, for garnish (optional)\n\nOptional substitutions: homemade chicken stock → store-bought low-sodium chicken stock; palm brown sugar → light brown sugar; red Gold potatoes → Yukon Gold potatoes",
